# What tools/pack_web_install.sh writes. Build output, not source: 3.1 MB, and a
# history cannot be rewritten to get rid of them again. The page, the device list and
# the script are versioned.
#
# The manifests are ignored too, and for a different reason: they carry the release
# number from include/FirmwareVersion.h, so a checked-in one could only ever be a
# stale one. tools/pack_web_install.sh regenerates them.
website/install/*.bin
website/install/manifest-*.json
